# Run logs are evidence, not source: they are large, machine-specific, and
# regenerated constantly. `tools/audits/flaky.py` reads whatever is here, so the
# directory must exist in a fresh clone even though its contents never do.
*.log
*.log.json
# An interrupted run keeps the `.partial` suffix so `flaky.py`'s `*.log` glob
# cannot mistake a third of a run for a whole one.
*.partial
*.partial.json
# A targeted run (`--scenario skills-mage`) is complete but is not cross-run
# material — one job compared against a full sweep reads as inconsistency.
*.scoped
*.scoped.json
